      'You see a whole assessment folded into one pair — tents or strong holds. "And what the land is that they dwell in, whether it be good or bad; and what cities they be that they dwell in, whether in tents, or in strong holds;" (Numbers 13:19) The quality of a brief is set before the inspector leaves.',
